{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/da39c6b25424fbf9a5ee9b882d6e2eae.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/da39c6b25424fbf9a5ee9b882d6e2eae.webm?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/da39c6b25424fbf9a5ee9b882d6e2eae.mp4?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teeto\u2019s got a talent for absorbing all sorts of objects - and turning them into wild new forms! With Nory\u2019s Vionite-powered backpack, they unlock unique abilities to outsmart enemies, solve puzzles, and discover hidden secrets. Mix it up, get creative, and see what strange new powers you\u2019ll unleash!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/4739c4e3cc7e2d266c7f0d5ad5bbac88.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/4739c4e3cc7e2d266c7f0d5ad5bbac88.webm?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/4739c4e3cc7e2d266c7f0d5ad5bbac88.mp4?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life\u2019s better with a buddy - and so is saving the world! Grab a friend and dive into split-screen co-op, where you\u2019ll absorb, transform, and explore together. Solve puzzles, help each other out, and take on this wild adventure side by side!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/e20d62c0259612979bc80fab30b062d9.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/e20d62c0259612979bc80fab30b062d9.webm?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/e20d62c0259612979bc80fab30b062d9.mp4?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos is spreading, and the shadow creatures are behind it! Teeto and Nory must team up, using their unique powers to stop the mayhem, restore balance, and keep the world from tipping into complete disorder!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/d2abc7093cccec72580fe9b8eeb9948f.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/d2abc7093cccec72580fe9b8eeb9948f.webm?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/d2abc7093cccec72580fe9b8eeb9948f.mp4?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It started with one Michael - Nory\u2019s first experiment. But Michael couldn\u2019t stay simple\u2026 he split into two, then four, then eight! Now there are too many Michaels for anyone to handle. Track them down, rescue them, and bring the tiny mischief-makers home!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/539072cf95a9bad7c2f07cc7e16989e5.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/539072cf95a9bad7c2f07cc7e16989e5.webm?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/539072cf95a9bad7c2f07cc7e16989e5.mp4?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Teeto and Nory aren\u2019t the only ones in need of help. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a colourful cast of quirky characters, each with their own oddball dilemmas. Lend them a hand, and they might just return the favour with useful items, hidden secrets, or unexpected abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ea2ac177c82c6d017ee9da76c310d7d3.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ea2ac177c82c6d017ee9da76c310d7d3.webm?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ea2ac177c82c6d017ee9da76c310d7d3.mp4?t=1772829827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Teeto\u2019s got a wardrobe full of wild outfits, from stylish to downright ridiculous. After all, saving the world is important - but looking good while doing it? That\u2019s just as crucial. Unlock new costumes and bring your own flair to the adventure!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783370?t=1772829827","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/10306e1609b29e817cdc217fb2933b88ee5f90d3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772829827","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/00c804b6036161a5001a7055399167a59fd9e3a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772829827","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/00c804b6036161a5001a7055399167a59fd9e3a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772829827","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2953830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/da39c6b25424fbf9a5ee9b882d6e2eae.poster.avif?t=1772829827\" width=616 height=3